(
K04 stress_pressure_factor (2026-10-06): Pro test stress_pressure_factor
(1D bar, E = 1, group_materi_elasti_stress_pressure_history_factor 0.5,
disx 0 -> -1 (t 1) -> 0 (t 2) -> -3 (t 5), dt 0.1). A step that starts
below the pressure history estimates its end pressure with the factored
stiffness and stays unloading/reloading only when the estimate is
strictly below the history (rule measured on the Professional
02-08-2026). Final sigxx -3.05 = Professional (the analytic -3 needs the
reloading step that ends exactly at the history to stay reloading; the
Professional takes it as first loading). GNU before K04: -3.10 (the
first-loading estimate switched one step early: -1.0 at t = 2.9).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
materi_stress_pressure_history
end_initia

node 1  0
node 2  1
element 1  -bar2 1 2

group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_memory 0  -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0  1.0
group_materi_elasti_stress_pressure_history_factor 0  0.5

bounda_dof    0  1 -velx
bounda_time   0  0.

bounda_dof    1  2 -disx
bounda_time   1  0. 0. 1. -1. 2. 0. 102. -100.

control_timestep 0  0.1 5.

target_item    0  -node_dof 2 -sigxx
target_value   0  -3.05 1.e-8
end_data
